WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:04.170
Hello, my name is Jason Blum, and this is
 my Must-See October Watchlist.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:11.745
I love re-watching, The Hills
 Have Eyes because it's so out there.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:14.347
Don't Look Now.
It's one of the most powerful films

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.416
in terms of atmosphere
I've ever, ever seen. 

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:19.319
I Know What You Did Last Summer, Scream

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.287
Invasion of the Body Snatchers.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:25.959
Look, I grew up watching Disney stuff,
so Halloweentown.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.761
Carrie is one of them

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:31.831
because I remember
the scream that I made

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.567
 when I saw the hand at the end.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.137
Rosemary's Baby, The Exorcist.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.472
30 Days of Night, Drag Me to Hell.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:45.078
28 Days Later. Those are things
 that I can watch on repeat.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:45.945
Persona.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:48.448
It is so psychologically terrifying.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.917
And of course, you got to throw in there
the little Gremlins,

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.019
because then it just reminds me,

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:55.455
Christmas is coming around the corner.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:57.457
So, that’s perfect for me.

